チャラ男達から「マジで今回あたりだわｗ」、「全身オナホすぎるだろこれｗ」などのセリフ。\n・ベリーは「イヤ゛ッ、ずっとイ゛ッでるっ、イ゛クのとまんなぃ、乳首おかしくなるぅ！！」などの快感に負けてるセリフ。\n\nセリフや構成は描きやすいように適宜調整していただいて大丈夫です。よろしくお願いします。", "nc": 40, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 78263, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "ケケ", "screen_name": "keke_kawa", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1268507773123416065/tIpQctfd.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/474935411/1779274789/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 7, "complete_expiration_days": 90, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "banned": false, "nc": 33}, {"id": 79065, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "シンオム🐺🔞", "screen_name": "sinomurice4645", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1792096217658499072/dVi-YmKe.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1792094836092506113/1722909606/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 32}, {"id": 425701, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "苔ちゃん", "screen_name": "kokechansama", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1250807578746970112/P7obzpZb.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/111593352/1588345281/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 60, "ski